        "cooked": "<p>Yes, the Lightning's Swift Strike&nbsp;Immensity Aspect does not replace any Special Rule/Innate Power/Unique Power Card, it is in addition to all of Lightning's Swift Strike's other rules/powers. This is because Immensity has both helpful and hindering rules, it balences itself out. Hope that helped!</p>",
